{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50377","headline":"辽东侍宴山夜临秋同赋临韵应诏 · 褚遂良","name":"辽东侍宴山夜临秋同赋临韵应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涿野轩皇陈，丹浦帝尧心。\n弯弧射封豕，解网纵前禽。\n慿高御爽节，流月扬清阴。\n雾匝长城险，云归渤澥深。\n飜垗入层汉，落雁警遥岑。\n露条疏更响，凉蝉寂不吟。\n三韩初静乱，八桂始披襟。\n商飚泛轻武，自涧引衣簮。\n酒漾投川醁，歌传芳树音。\n边烽良永□，麾旆竦成林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚遂良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}